# Builds the CrossByte half of the browser interoperability test.
#
# This is the only test in the repository whose result depends on another
# implementation. Everything else proves this code agrees with itself; a real
# RTCPeerConnection is what says whether the wire formats are the ones the rest
# of the world uses.
#
# Run it with `node ci/interop/run.js` once built.
-cp src
-cp tests
-cp tests/interop
-D windows
-D HXCPP_M64
-main BrowserInteropPeer
--cpp export/interop
